# Two sword bots duel on a flat world, one expert and one average. The camera is moved next to the
# fight before every capture because the bots do not stay where they started.
gamemode spectator Viewer
time set noon
weather clear
bot spawn Expert sword expert at 0.5 -60 0.5
bot spawn Average sword average at 10.5 -60 0.5
tp Viewer 5.5 -57.5 -7.5 0 18
sleep 5
shot sword-duel-01-spawned
bot duel Expert Average
sleep 4
execute at Expert run tp Viewer ~4 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Expert eyes
sleep 1
shot sword-duel-02-fighting
sleep 2
execute at Expert run tp Viewer ~4 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Expert eyes
sleep 1
shot sword-duel-03-fighting
sleep 2
execute at Average run tp Viewer ~-4 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Average eyes
sleep 1
shot sword-duel-04-fighting
bot stats Expert
bot stats Average
sleep 1
